<title>UK: Halifax says Cazenove joint broker on float.</title>
<headline>Halifax says Cazenove joint broker on float.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Halifax Building Society said it has appointed Cazenove &amp; Co as joint broker for its proposed conversion and stock market flotation later this year.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Cazenove will work with Merrill Lynch which remains lead broker for the issue. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
